Tracewick Agent
Copyright 2026 The Tracewick Authors

This product includes software developed by The Tracewick Authors
(https://github.com/tracewick/agent).

Tracewick Agent delivers profiles produced by the Tracewick PHP library
(https://github.com/tracewick/tracewick). It is an independent Go process; no
PHP library source is vendored into this repository except public test fixtures
copied under their Apache-2.0 terms when added.
